{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"jean-claude-leuyer","name":"Jean Claude Leuyer","birthDate":"1970-11-30","birthPlace":"Phoenix, Arizona, USA","bio":"Jean-Claude Leuyer, or simply Jean Claude, is an American former super heavyweight kickboxer. He was a six-time world champion, holding titles in four different organizations, and competing in sixteen world title fights. He holds notable wins over Rob Kaman and Tomasz Kucharzewski in K-1.\n\nSince his retirement from fighting, Leuyer has appeared in a number of films as an actor and stunt man, including Jet Li's Fearless.[14] He is also a trainer at the American Kickboxing Academy.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T18:05:46+00:00","tmdbId":52904,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/52904","credits":[{"id":"logan","title":"Logan","character":"Reaver"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/jean-claude-leuyer.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Alto Knights","year":2025,"character":"Assassin","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/epGF8vv3caKLm6X8PKbD5xirFLa.jpg"},{"name":"Reminiscence","year":2021,"character":"Massive Prisoner","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/17siH6wJRQ2jZiqz9BWUhy1UtZ.jpg"},{"name":"Black Water","year":2018,"character":"Guard 2","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qvcJ2gPPELyoGkuUgVZ3JV7Jxb8.jpg"},{"name":"Cobra Kai","year":2018,"character":"Derek","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5qMupAz4A9EN5Rutrkmov45mNXZ.jpg"},{"name":"Logan","year":2017,"character":"Reaver","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fnbjcRDYn6YviCcePDnGdyAkYsB.jpg"},{"name":"The Babysitter","year":2017,"character":"Cop #2","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uAzKNxGnbK5SL7VF7UeQyZdQLHV.jpg"},{"name":"S.W.A.T.","year":2017,"character":"Bobby","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1l7vsAIkqOzrqiPwjO27Cb5QdfJ.jpg"},{"name":"The Free World","year":2016,"char